WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.166
- They told me I was a lineman, not a frontman.

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:04.291
- This is our big chance!

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:06.208
Every single person from the media showed up.

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:08.041
- I have a major announcement.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.791
It's the Eagles!
[Audience cheering]

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.708
The football team.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:11.541
- [Audience:] Aww.

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:14.833
- Jingle bells, jingle bells...
[Snickering]

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:17.166
♪♪♪ Jingle all the way. ♪♪♪
[Cheering]

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:19.541
- Oh, my God, they're better than the Chiefs!

00:00:20.416 --> 00:00:22.416
- Eaglemania swept the nation.

00:00:22.416 --> 00:00:26.041
And who managed that s--t but me, Nicky Sirianni?

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:28.666
- I heard you're looking for a little of that Nashville sound.

00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:31.416
- So, crikey, the head 'ranger wanted to add some joeys.

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:33.291
- He means Sirianni added some folks.

00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:36.333
- Things did get a little weird when the band entered their Batman era.

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:39.333
- ♪♪♪ Dark Knight,

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:42.416
Bruce Wayne. ♪♪♪

00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:44.833
- They were the Eagles, but then they added bats.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.083
It was too many animals.

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:49.416
- You've changed, Jason. I'm supposed to be the hot brother.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.666
- ♪♪♪ You're a mean one, Mr. Snyder. ♪♪♪

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:52.916
[Cheering]

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:55.666
- We got upstaged by the f--king Commanders.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:59.458
- ♪♪♪ Daboll, Daboll, Daboll.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.916
The refs threw the game our way. ♪♪♪

00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:02.166
- Maybe I could play lead?

00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:03.166
- Quiet, Tony Pollard!

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:04.333
Zeke's the star.

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:07.291
- We had to get back to what got us there in the first place.

00:01:07.291 --> 00:01:08.416
- No rules, just right.

00:01:08.416 --> 00:01:10.416
- This one goes out to all the haters.

00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:13.041
♪♪♪ We wish you a Merry Christmas! ♪♪♪

